<Template>
  <WidgetGroup>
    <ObjectName>Topbar</ObjectName>
    <Layout>vertical</Layout>
    <Size>0me,100f</Size>
    <Children>
      <WidgetGroup>
        <ObjectName>TabControls</ObjectName>
        <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
        <SizePolicy>me,me</SizePolicy>
        <Children>
          <WidgetGroup>
            <ObjectName>MixxxVersionStack</ObjectName>
            <Layout>stacked</Layout>
            <Size>110f,100f</Size>
            <Children>
              <PushButton>
                <ObjectName>MixxxVersionHit</ObjectName>
                <Size>110f,100f</Size>
                <NumberStates>1</NumberStates>
                <State><Number>0</Number><Text></Text></State>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],prefs_btn</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
              </PushButton>
              <WidgetGroup>
                <ObjectName>MixxxVersionBox</ObjectName>
                <Layout>vertical</Layout>
                <SizePolicy>max,me</SizePolicy>
                <Children>
                  <Label>
                    <ObjectName>MixxxVersionName</ObjectName>
                    <Text>Mixxx</Text>
                  </Label>
                  <!-- The number under the name is written by hand, twice, and
                       one of the two is chosen at load time. Nothing in the
                       skin parser hands a skin the running Mixxx's version.
                       The <version> in skin.xml is this skin's own, and no
                       stock skin displays the application's. So a single
                       hardcoded number is a claim nobody checks, and it was
                       already going to be wrong the first time this skin ran
                       on 2.6.

                       The only question a skin can ask about the Mixxx running
                       it is whether some control exists, so that is the
                       question asked here.
                       [QuickEffectRack1_[Channel1_Stem1]],num_effectslots is
                       created when 2.6 builds the QuickEffect chain of deck
                       1's first stem, at startup and not at track load, and it
                       is read-only, so nothing on the box can move it. 2.5.6
                       has no stem chains, the parser invents the key at zero,
                       and the zero is what selects 2.5.6 below.

                       Two limits, both worth knowing before trusting it. The
                       strings are still hand-maintained and they live here,
                       nowhere else; and the test has two answers, so a Mixxx
                       newer than 2.6 that still has stem chains will read 2.6
                       until somebody adds a third label. That is a badge one
                       version behind rather than a badge that never moves.
                       docs/the-skin.md says the same at more length. -->
                  <Label>
                    <ObjectName>MixxxVersionNum</ObjectName>
                    <Text>2.5.6</Text>
                    <Connection>
                      <ConfigKey>[QuickEffectRack1_[Channel1_Stem1]],num_effectslots</ConfigKey>
                      <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                      <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
                    </Connection>
                  </Label>
                  <Label>
                    <ObjectName>MixxxVersionNum</ObjectName>
                    <Text>2.6</Text>
                    <Connection>
                      <ConfigKey>[QuickEffectRack1_[Channel1_Stem1]],num_effectslots</ConfigKey>
                      <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
                    </Connection>
                  </Label>
                </Children>
              </WidgetGroup>
            </Children>
          </WidgetGroup>
          <Template src="skin:tab.xml">
            <SetVariable name="tab_name">Waveform</SetVariable>
            <SetVariable name="config_key">overview</SetVariable>
          </Template>
          <WidgetGroup>
            <ObjectName>DeckModeGroup</ObjectName>
            <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
            <SizePolicy>max,max</SizePolicy>
            <Children>
              <!-- The three deck modes. A connection carries one control and a
                   press sends the same value to every one of them, so a button
                   that has to leave several flags in a particular combination
                   needs one connection each, with <Not/> on the ones that have
                   to land at zero: nothing in a legacy skin fans one value out
                   to many controls, so the button itself is the fan-out. Each
                   button raises its own mode flag last, because the last
                   connection that reads back is the display connection, and
                   that is what the white highlight in style.qss keys off.
                   2/4 DECK is the middle setting in the Pioneer sense: all four
                   decks stay on screen as cards, but only the mixing pair gets
                   a waveform lane, so those two lanes run full height. -->
              <PushButton>
                <ObjectName>DeckModeBtn2</ObjectName>
                <Size>132f,76f</Size>
                <NumberStates>1</NumberStates>
                <State><Number>0</Number><Text>2 DECK</Text></State>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_wf3</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_wf4</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_smalltop</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_smallbot</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_bigtop</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_cardbot</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode24</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode4</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode2</ConfigKey>
                </Connection>
              </PushButton>
              <PushButton>
                <ObjectName>DeckModeBtn24</ObjectName>
                <Size>152f,76f</Size>
                <NumberStates>1</NumberStates>
                <State><Number>0</Number><Text>2/4 DECK</Text></State>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_wf3</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_wf4</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_smalltop</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_smallbot</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_bigtop</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_cardbot</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode2</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode4</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode24</ConfigKey>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],profile2</ConfigKey>
                  <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
              </PushButton>
              <PushButton>
                <ObjectName>DeckModeBtn4</ObjectName>
                <Size>132f,76f</Size>
                <NumberStates>1</NumberStates>
                <State><Number>0</Number><Text>4 DECK</Text></State>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_wf3</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_wf4</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_smalltop</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_smallbot</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],card_bigtop</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],show_cardbot</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode2</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode24</ConfigKey>
                  <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],mode4</ConfigKey>
                </Connection>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],profile2</ConfigKey>
                  <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
                  <Transform><Not/></Transform>
                </Connection>
              </PushButton>
            </Children>
          </WidgetGroup>
          <Template src="skin:tab.xml">
            <SetVariable name="tab_name">Browse</SetVariable>
            <SetVariable name="config_key">library</SetVariable>
          </Template>
          <WidgetGroup>
            <ObjectName>SingleContinueGroup</ObjectName>
            <Layout>stacked</Layout>
            <Size>240f,80f</Size>
            <Children>
              <PushButton>
                <ObjectName>SingleContinueHit</ObjectName>
                <Size>240f,80f</Size>
                <NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
                <State><Number>0</Number><Text></Text></State>
                <State><Number>1</Number><Text></Text></State>
                <Connection>
                  <ConfigKey>[AutoDJ],enabled</ConfigKey>
                </Connection>
              </PushButton>
              <WidgetGroup>
                <ObjectName>SingleContinueLabels</ObjectName>
                <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
                <Size>240f,80f</Size>
                <Children>
                  <Label>
                    <ObjectName>ScSingle</ObjectName>
                    <Text>SINGLE</Text>
                    <Connection>
                      <ConfigKey>[AutoDJ],enabled</ConfigKey>
                      <Transform><IsEqual>0</IsEqual></Transform>
                      <BindProperty>highlight</BindProperty>
                    </Connection>
                  </Label>
                  <Label>
                    <ObjectName>ScSep</ObjectName>
                    <Text>|</Text>
                  </Label>
                  <Label>
                    <ObjectName>ScContinue</ObjectName>
                    <Text>CONTINUE</Text>
                    <Connection>
                      <ConfigKey>[AutoDJ],enabled</ConfigKey>
                      <Transform><IsEqual>1</IsEqual></Transform>
                      <BindProperty>highlight</BindProperty>
                    </Connection>
                  </Label>
                </Children>
              </WidgetGroup>
            </Children>
          </WidgetGroup>
          <WidgetGroup>
            <ObjectName>TopStatus</ObjectName>
            <Layout>vertical</Layout>
            <SizePolicy>max,me</SizePolicy>
            <Children>
              <WidgetGroup>
                <ObjectName>TopStatusColumns</ObjectName>
                <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
                <SizePolicy>me,me</SizePolicy>
                <Children>
                  <WidgetGroup>
                    <ObjectName>TopStatusStats</ObjectName>
                    <Layout>vertical</Layout>
                    <SizePolicy>max,me</SizePolicy>
                    <Children>
                      <WidgetGroup>
                        <ObjectName>TopStatusLoadRow</ObjectName>
                        <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
                        <SizePolicy>max,max</SizePolicy>
                        <Children>
                          <Label>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusLoadLabel</ObjectName>
                            <Text>LOAD</Text>
                          </Label>
                          <Number>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusLoad</ObjectName>
                            <TooltipId>audio_latency_usage</TooltipId>
                            <SizePolicy>max,max</SizePolicy>
                            <NumberOfDigits>0</NumberOfDigits>
                            <Connection>
                              <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],load</ConfigKey>
                            </Connection>
                          </Number>
                          <Label>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusLoadUnit</ObjectName>
                            <Text>%</Text>
                          </Label>
                        </Children>
                      </WidgetGroup>
                      <WidgetGroup>
                        <ObjectName>TopStatusCpuRow</ObjectName>
                        <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
                        <SizePolicy>max,max</SizePolicy>
                        <Children>
                          <Label>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusCpuLabel</ObjectName>
                            <Text>CPU</Text>
                          </Label>
                          <Number>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusCpu</ObjectName>
                            <NumberOfDigits>0</NumberOfDigits>
                            <Connection>
                              <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],cpu</ConfigKey>
                            </Connection>
                          </Number>
                          <Label>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusCpuUnit</ObjectName>
                            <Text>%</Text>
                          </Label>
                        </Children>
                      </WidgetGroup>
                      <WidgetGroup>
                        <ObjectName>TopStatusTempRow</ObjectName>
                        <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
                        <SizePolicy>max,max</SizePolicy>
                        <Children>
                          <Number>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusTemp</ObjectName>
                            <NumberOfDigits>0</NumberOfDigits>
                            <Connection>
                              <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],temp</ConfigKey>
                            </Connection>
                          </Number>
                          <Label>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusTempUnit</ObjectName>
                            <Text>&#176;C</Text>
                          </Label>
                          <PushButton>
                            <ObjectName>TopStatusAudioBtn</ObjectName>
                            <Size>44f,20f</Size>
                            <NumberStates>1</NumberStates>
                            <State><Number>0</Number><Text>OUT</Text></State>
                            <Connection>
                              <ConfigKey>[Pioneered],audio_btn</ConfigKey>
                              <ConnectValueToWidget>false</ConnectValueToWidget>
                            </Connection>
                          </PushButton>
                        </Children>
                      </WidgetGroup>
                    </Children>
                  </WidgetGroup>
                  <Time>
                    <ObjectName>TopStatusClock</ObjectName>
                    <TooltipId>time</TooltipId>
                  </Time>
                </Children>
              </WidgetGroup>
            </Children>
          </WidgetGroup>

        </Children>
      </WidgetGroup>
    </Children>
  </WidgetGroup>
</Template>
